{"text": " Give us the exact address, and we'll destroy it.\" That reply appeared under a photo of a house on X. It came from the president of El Salvador. A woman had posted a picture of a house in Haiti. She said a criminal gang had built it. She asked Nayib Bukele to destroy the building, and got that reply. Other users began posting coordinates in the comments. By then, Salvadoran troops were already in Haiti. Four days after his reply, Bukele posted a video. Helicopters fire rockets at buildings. Smoke rises above the buildings. Bukele said the gang leader's house and the gang's headquarters had been destroyed. Under the video, he wrote, We kept our promise. That's how the president said he'd followed through on what he'd written under someone else's photo.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.06, "text": " Give us the exact address, and we'll destroy it.\"", "tokens": [50364, 5303, 505, 264, 1900, 2985, 11, 293, 321, 603, 5293, 309, 889, 50520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0901376724243164, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 0.002362468745559454, "words": [{"word": " Give", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2, "probability": 0.7797784805297852}, {"word": " us", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.36, "probability": 0.9946828484535217}, {"word": " the", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.48, "probability": 0.9954695701599121}, {"word": " exact", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.88, "probability": 0.9970619082450867}, {"word": " address,", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.22, "probability": 0.9984328150749207}, {"word": " and", "start": 1.6, "end": 1.8, "probability": 0.9963359832763672}, {"word": " we'll", "start": 1.8, "end": 2.02, "probability": 0.9854245781898499}, {"word": " destroy", "start": 2.02, "end": 2.4, "probability": 0.9968011379241943}, {"word": " it.\"", "start": 2.4, "end": 3.06, "probability": 0.5753039345145226}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.06, "end": 8.1, "text": " That reply appeared under a photo of a house on X. It came from the p